# Microservices Split & UI Restoration Complete!

Maine aapke instructions ke hisab se backend ko 2 parts mein split kar diya hai (Microservices Architecture), aur frontend mein journey search ki live tracking UI wapas restore kar di hai!

## 1. Microservices Architecture (The Backend Split)

![Engine Terminal](https://img.shields.io/badge/Microservices-Engine-blue)
![API Terminal](https://img.shields.io/badge/Microservices-API-green)

Humne ek naya standalone service banaya hai **`apps/engine`**.
Ab kaam ka batwara (division of labor) kuch is tarah hoga:

1. **`apps/engine` (Data Ingestion & Route Learning):**
   - Yeh engine UPSRTC se live data scrape karega, PostgreSQL database me save karega, aur nayi routes seekhega (Autonomous Route Seeder).
   - Yeh bina kisi HTTP port ke background mein chup-chap apna kaam karega, isliye yeh kabhi bhi API ko slow nahi karega!

2. **`apps/backend` (User API & WebSockets):**
   - Yeh siraf REST API requests aur WebSocket connections ko handle karega.
   - Kyunki isme ab koi bhaari background task nahi chal raha, yeh user ki searches ko **makkhan ki tarah** instantly respond karega. Event loop kabhi block nahi hoga!

### Aapko kya karna hai?
Aapko abse apne terminal mein **teen (3)** commands chalani hongi:
1. `npm run dev` (in `apps/web-app`)
2. `npm run dev` (in `apps/backend`)
3. **`npm run dev` (in `apps/engine`)** 👈 Yeh naya hai!

