## 2. Frontend Map & Tracking UI Restoration

> "phle usmai track krne ka bhi tha map bhi tha ek baar pichla code dekho ache se"

Aapka matlab bilkul sahi tha! Pehle jab aap direct routes search karte the, toh us par click karte hi **Left side** par ek poora stops ka timeline ("Where is my train" jaisa) khul jata tha aur map par bus track hone lagti thi. Lekin naye Journey Planner mein yeh feature dab gaya tha.

Maine ise fix kar diya hai:
- **Auto-Tracking on Selection:** Ab jab bhi aap koi "Available Way" (Journey option) select karenge, system **automatically** uss option ki live bus ko dhoondhega aur Right Panel mein uska Map aur Stops Timeline khol dega!
- Aapko ab manually "Track Bus" button dabane ki zarurat nahi hai, yeh pehle ki tarah seamless ho gaya hai.

