### Verification (Aap ise test kaise karein?)

1. Apne terminals restart kijiye aur teeno apps (`web-app`, `backend`, `engine`) ko `npm run dev` se start karein.
2. Web App mein jakar **"Saharanpur to Gangoh"** search karein.
3. Kisi bhi route (Available Way) par click karein.
4. Note karein ki right side mein **Map aur Stops Timeline (Where is my train)** automatically track hona shuru ho jayega! Aur API bilkul lag-free chalegi.
